<<
/Title (Every time our elders wanted to join a satsang, book a cab, or even video-call a grandchild, they needed someone else to do it for them. Not because they lack the desire to connect; but because every app, every OTP, every tiny icon was built for someone else's generation. That dependency quietly steals their dignity. Vyavahaar exists to give it back.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 685 0 R
/Next 838 0 R
